"text": "Your drive needs a tune-up, and Windows does it for free.\nOpen Defragment and Optimize Drives from the Start menu.\nSelect your C drive.\nClick Optimize.\nOn an SSD, Windows sends a trim command, which keeps it fast.\nFollow for more Windows fixes."
